# A European combined layer: national open orthophoto services where one
# exists and still works, with ArcGIS World Imagery (Arc@) as the global
# fallback base layer, so every European tile builds even outside the
# national extents (Ireland, UK, Denmark, Norway, Slovakia, Greece,
# Albania, the Balkans, ...). Layers paint in reverse file order: the
# last line is the
# base, the first line ends up on top. All endpoints live-verified
# 2026-07-17.

BE_Vl        Vlanderen      none    high

FIN          Finland        none    medium
EST          Estonia        none    medium
LT           Lithuania      none    medium
SE2          Sweden         none    medium
DOP20_NRW    NRW            none    medium
PL           Poland         none    medium
CZ           Czechia        none    medium
NL           Netherlands    none    medium
BE_Fr        Wallonie       none    medium
Lux          Luxembourg     none    medium
FRorth       France         none    medium
CH           Switzerland    none    medium
OST          Austria        none    medium
HU           Hungary        none    medium
PCN06        Italy          none    medium
SLO          Slovenia       none    medium
CRO_2016     CRO_2016       none    medium
CRO_2011     CRO_add2011    none    medium
SP           Spain          none    medium
PTSAT        Portugal       none    medium

Arc@         global         none    low
